# addons for meimei mod menu 

## If you want to download these addons and import them in meimei OS what you need to do is:

1. Go to the release and chose your addon
2. Rightclick on the zip of the release
3. Chose "copy link address"

4. go in meimei OS in Orion Drift
5. click on Terminal (Term)
6. Type in: "addon add" and then the link that you just copied

### A example of what the command in the terminal should look like is:
"addon add https://github.com/Plushivr/meimei-addons/releases/download/v3/specv2.zip"

## Uninstall:
Go to the terminal and type in "addon remove" and  then the name of the addon

### A example of what the command in the terminal should look like is:
"addon remove specv2"
